  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Domain**\n\nI\'ve examined the `ic_launcher.xml` and it seems flawless. I\'m now fully focused on the domain model and static dataset for AI Academy. I must include all 11 categories and 87 technologies from the brief. I\'m starting to list them, ensuring complete coverage.\n\n\n**Listing the Technologies**\n\nI\'ve made great progress! I\'ve now listed all the technologies, including LLMs, Agentic frameworks, RAG, Embedding models, and MCP components. It\'s a comprehensive inventory of the key components for the AI Academy. I have double-checked everything and made sure that all technologies, from OpenAI GPT to Slack MCP Server, are accounted for.\n\n\n**Categorizing the Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into organizing the listed technologies into distinct categories. I\'ve finished grouping these into the following sections: PostgreSQL MCP Server, Google Drive MCP Server, Filesystem MCP Server, Security (8), Observability (8), Memory (8), Agent SDK (7), Workflow (9), and Vector DB (9). I\'ve meticulously ensured all components are accounted for, even cross-category tools like Redis and Chroma. The total count, including those, is 89 entries!\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
