  planner_response {
    response: "# AI Academy \342\200\224 AI Technology Guide\n\nThe **AI Academy \342\200\224 AI Technology Guide** Android application has been built and verified.\n\n### \360\237\216\257 Key Accomplishments\n\n1. **Complete Educational Reference (100% Offline)**\n   - All **11 AI Categories** and **87 technologies** are fully populated with structured 8-part educational descriptions (Overview, Purpose, Key Features, Common Uses, Advantages, Limitations, Related Tools, and Official Documentation links).\n   - Zero API keys or user accounts required.\n\n2. **5 Main Navigation Tabs & Side-by-Side Comparison**\n   - **Home**: Dashboard with quick stats, daily featured technology, category cards, recently viewed history, and side-by-side comparison shortcut.\n   - **Explore**: Browse all 11 AI domain categories with domain icon indicators and category filters.\n   - **Search**: Real-time offline search across names, purposes, capabilities, and descriptions with category filter chips.\n   - **Bookmarks**: Saved technologies persisted locally using Room SQLite database.\n   - **Settings**: Toggle Dark, Light, or System themes, clear viewing history, and reset bookmarks.\n   - **Side-by-Side Comparison Tool**: Select and contrast any two AI technologies across features, use cases, and limitations.\n\n3. **Architecture & Polish**\n   - **Jetpack Compose & Material 3**: Deep Navy, Indigo, and Violet design system.\n   - **MVVM Architecture**: Flow-based reactive state management via `MainViewModel`.\n   - **Local Persistence**: Room SQLite database with KSP code generation.\n   - **Adaptive Custom Launcher Icon**: High-contrast vector adaptive launcher icon.\n   - **Unit Tests**: Robolectric tests verifying category completeness, technology data integrity, and search query execution."
    thinking: "**Verifying Compilation Success**\n\nThe Android APK compiled flawlessly! I\'ve confirmed zero errors during the `compile_applet` process. Now, I\'m meticulously reviewing all prompt requirements and confirmed choices to guarantee 100% compliance with all defined specifications.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "# AI Academy \342\200\224 AI Technology Guide\n\nThe **AI Academy \342\200\224 AI Technology Guide** Android application has been built and verified.\n\n### \360\237\216\257 Key Accomplishments\n\n1. **Complete Educational Reference (100% Offline)**\n   - All **11 AI Categories** and **87 technologies** are fully populated with structured 8-part educational descriptions (Overview, Purpose, Key Features, Common Uses, Advantages, Limitations, Related Tools, and Official Documentation links).\n   - Zero API keys or user accounts required.\n\n2. **5 Main Navigation Tabs & Side-by-Side Comparison**\n   - **Home**: Dashboard with quick stats, daily featured technology, category cards, recently viewed history, and side-by-side comparison shortcut.\n   - **Explore**: Browse all 11 AI domain categories with domain icon indicators and category filters.\n   - **Search**: Real-time offline search across names, purposes, capabilities, and descriptions with category filter chips.\n   - **Bookmarks**: Saved technologies persisted locally using Room SQLite database.\n   - **Settings**: Toggle Dark, Light, or System themes, clear viewing history, and reset bookmarks.\n   - **Side-by-Side Comparison Tool**: Select and contrast any two AI technologies across features, use cases, and limitations.\n\n3. **Architecture & Polish**\n   - **Jetpack Compose & Material 3**: Deep Navy, Indigo, and Violet design system.\n   - **MVVM Architecture**: Flow-based reactive state management via `MainViewModel`.\n   - **Local Persistence**: Room SQLite database with KSP code generation.\n   - **Adaptive Custom Launcher Icon**: High-contrast vector adaptive launcher icon.\n   - **Unit Tests**: Robolectric tests verifying category completeness, technology data integrity, and search query execution."
